f you are part of a bookclub or run one in Bangalore that can be added to these lists, Please email us. I will eventually create another post logging every bookclub in this country but I will need more help for that","blocks":[{"t":"entries","entries":[{"name":"Broke Bibliophiles Bangalore","f":[["Status","Active",""],["Medium","Physical Meetups (Online when required)",""],["How to Reach","Facebook group, Twitter (bibliophilesblr), attend monthly meetups by RSVP",""]]},{"name":"Bring Your Own Book","f":[["Status","Active",""],["Medium","Currently Online",""],["How to Reach","Join the Facebook group, Twitter (BYOBIndia), attend monthly meetups by RSVP",""]]},{"name":"Atta Galatta Book Club","f":[["Status","Currently Inactive",""],["Medium","Physical Meetups",""],["How to Reach","Twitter (AttaGalatta), Instagram",""]]},{"name":"Champaca Book Club","f":[["Status","Information Needed",""],["Medium","Information Needed",""],["How to Reach","Twitter (ChampacaBooks), Instagram",""]]},{"name":"Under The Lamp","f":[["Status","Information Needed",""],["Medium","Physical Meetups",""],["How to Reach","Instagram",""]]}]}]},{"slug":"all-about-bangalore","title":"Books on Bangalore","date":"2021-10-09","intro":"The following are some recommendations related to our beautiful city of Bangalore. They’ve been collated from discussions on different social media either actively or from passive observations. We welcome recommendations that you’ve found interesting that can be added to these lists. Please email us.","blocks":[{"t":"h","x":"History, the Present and places in the city/ Non-Fiction"},{"t":"books","rows":[{"x":"The Promise Of The Metropolis: Bangalore’s Twentieth Century","id":null,"href":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/1122257.The_Promise_Of_The_Metropolis"},{"x":"Discovering Bengaluru","id":"7c275734-fd64-43dc-bd53-0dce268454d7","href":"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/50026421-discovering-bengaluru"},{"x":"Askew: A Short Biography of Bangalore","id":null,"href":"ht